    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly from hideout to hideout, dodge gentle dangers, and watch your poem change with each choice. <i>small bird poem </i>is a short, interactive journey through natural and urban bird habitats. Play it with your youngest \u2014 or alone, for a quiet evening or bedtime moment.<strong> </strong> <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>NOTE: THIS IS A SIMPLE SHORT GAME!</strong><br><i><strong>Likely too slow or boring for teens or adults playing alone \u2014 but perfect to enjoy with a small child, or if you just need something gentle to wind down before sleep.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>It was created as a way to explore the full game development and publishing process in preparation for a larger project. The upcoming demo is a standalone, complete little story\u2014and who knows, maybe one day it\u2019ll grow into something bigger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find Your Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide from perch to perch across meadows, branches, and rooftops. Every path is a quiet choice.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680140/extras/786f730852ccda3e8c81e5ad1bed72d2.poster.avif?t=1748553179\" width=746 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680140/extras/786f730852ccda3e8c81e5ad1bed72d2.webm?t=1748553179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680140/extras/786f730852ccda3e8c81e5ad1bed72d2.mp4?t=1748553179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Navigate Gentle Dangers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some gaps hold a soft challenge. Get hit, and you\u2019ll lose a feather \u2014 and the poem will change with you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680140/extras/5b2d025efe7596d398581991d0317e2b.poster.avif?t=1748553179\" width=746 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680140/extras/5b2d025efe7596d398581991d0317e2b.webm?t=1748553179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680140/extras/5b2d025efe7596d398581991d0317e2b.mp4?t=1748553179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape the Poem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where you land, how you move, and what you face may shift the verses that follow.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680140/extras/24875ffb21985d2a8501ada9135a3827.poster.avif?t=1748553179\" width=746 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680140/extras/24875ffb21985d2a8501ada9135a3827.webm?t=1748553179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680140/extras/24875ffb21985d2a8501ada9135a3827.mp4?t=1748553179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pause and Take It In</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perch. Breathe. Let the scenery unfold. The poem becomes a reflection of the quiet you leave behind.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680140/extras/3507dff34f7a4658617fa89f7aa560a1.poster.avif?t=1748553179\" width=746 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680140/extras/3507dff34f7a4658617fa89f7aa560a1.webm?t=1748553179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680140/extras/3507dff34f7a4658617fa89f7aa560a1.mp4?t=1748553179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A gentle, interactive journey</strong> through natural and urban bird habitats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio narration</strong> \u2014 available in English and German for a more storybook-like experience</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable with a child or alone</strong> \u2014 designed for quiet evenings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No game over</strong> \u2014 just different verses depending on how you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted by a human</strong> \u2014 every asset, word, and sound made with care</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
